Dialogue: 99,0:00:02.98,0:00:05.69,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Y-You want to have
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.69,0:00:08.24,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,a five-day fuckathon?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.43,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.43,0:00:13.74,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Is there any better way \Nto spend your five days of vacation?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.94,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,But what about things like eating?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.94,0:00:18.99,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be doing it nonstop.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.13,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,For instance, we'd start with...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.13,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Hugging,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.38,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,and simply holding hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.64,0:00:31.90,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}We'll spend four days entirely on foreplay \Nand save the main event for the very end.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.99,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I think that would make for a lovely vacation.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.99,0:00:38.02,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.91,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko, would it make you happy if we did that?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.91,0:00:45.02,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.56,0:00:48.96,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:48.96,0:00:49.73,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.65,0:00:55.64,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,We'll start with a day of slowly sharing our affection.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.64,0:00:57.66,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}She pinned me against the wall?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.95,0:01:01.28,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one's ever cornered me like this before.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.67,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's kinda...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.53,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's kinda cute.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.18,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is different from how we usually make out.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.18,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Is kissing all we're doing today?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.96,0:01:20.79,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.52,0:01:25.16,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wasn't quite sure what to expect at first,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.16,0:01:28.24,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}but taking it slow like this isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.07,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,N-Nadeshiko!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.61,0:01:36.08,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,You said we were saving this for the very end!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.70,0:01:40.27,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, touching below the waist \Nis off-limits for today,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.27,0:01:43.60,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,so I'm helping myself to your top half instead.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.24,0:01:49.22,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko! Come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.21,0:01:52.14,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,All right! That's enough for today.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.50,0:01:56.49,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}We're saving the climax \Nfor the final day, remember?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.49,0:01:58.07,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? But...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.55,0:02:03.77,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm too horny to fall asleep!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.07,0:02:11.34,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Shall we focus on your lower body today?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.34,0:02:12.25,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.83,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.27,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,the groin,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.25,0:02:17.97,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,stroking your tummy,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.49,0:02:20.87,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,or teasing you with my fingers.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.44,0:02:28.58,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it. She's just going to work me up again.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.89,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it feels this good now,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.89,0:02:33.79,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}what on earth is tomorrow gonna be like?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.65,0:02:36.89,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.41,0:02:40.52,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,are you ready to begin, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.35,0:02:45.02,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been so unfulfilled, I can't even sleep!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.02,0:02:47.02,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.30,0:02:48.82,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,If I may, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.28,0:02:55.78,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}All that from just one finger?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.24,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Um, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.39,0:03:02.79,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you wait so long,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.79,0:03:06.79,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,but I need you to hold on just a little longer, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.09,0:03:06.79,Alt,Akane,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.46,0:03:12.27,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Right now, the slightest stimulation \Ncan cause incredible pleasure.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.82,0:03:16.11,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,So let's take our time so you can get used to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.51,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.51,0:03:21.49,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.49,0:03:22.49,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.15,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.15,0:03:25.56,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.28,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I just want you to feel as good as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.11,0:03:42.79,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.79,0:03:45.42,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,You don't have to hold back anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.42,0:03:47.83,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Feel free to tell me what you want me to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.46,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,M-More...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.22,0:03:54.18,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I just need more!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.18,0:03:54.99,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.10,0:04:00.18,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,I'm working from home tomorrow...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.18,0:04:03.85,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry! Did I overdo it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.57,0:04:08.76,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Regardless, I'm so happy right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.76,0:04:12.77,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I feel like I've finally fulfilled my purpose.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.77,0:04:14.36,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.83,0:04:18.12,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,Yes! Just like a washing machine or a microwave!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.12,0:04:19.24,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.56,0:04:23.80,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}Nadeshiko sure says some \Nrobotic things from time to time.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.80,0:04:26.55,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}She obviously seems fond of me,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.98,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}but is that just her sexbot programming?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.98,0:04:31.50,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I love it...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:31.82,0:04:36.62,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I get to keep hearing you call me by my name.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.62,0:04:40.76,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,{\q2}Every time I hear you say "Nadeshiko," \Nit makes me feel so good inside.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.15,0:04:44.53,Default,Nadeshiko,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to hear it so many times today.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.99,0:04:47.89,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.67,0:04:50.41,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.73,Default,Akane,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't need to overthink things for now.
